sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant A as lowpriv (attacker)
  participant CA as ADESC-Root-CA
  participant DC as KDC
  Note over A,CA: Template ESC1 = ENROLLEE_SUPPLIES_SUBJECT + Client Auth EKU + low-priv enroll
  A->>CA: req -template ESC1 -upn administrator@adescrtl.lab -sid <admin SID>
  CA->>CA: Subject taken from REQUEST (attacker-controlled)
  CA-->>A: Certificate with SAN = administrator
  A->>DC: PKINIT with certificate
  DC-->>A: TGT as administrator -> NT hash
